# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Hive Authority Kernel — environment reference
# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) and fill in. NEVER commit real tokens.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Gateway (HTTP API on :8787) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# HIVE_API_HOST / HIVE_API_PORT      — bind address (default 0.0.0.0:8787)
# HIVE_DB_PATH                       — SQLite WAL path (default .hive/live.db)
# HIVE_GATEWAY_TOKEN                 — when set, every /api/* except GET /api/health
#                                      requires: Authorization: Bearer <token>
#                                      Leave UNSET for local dev (open).
# HIVE_GATEWAY_TOKEN=

# ── Effect integrations (outbox: open-pr, merge, post-github, open-branch, post-slack)
# HIVE_INTEGRATIONS=auto             — auto | live | simulation
#   auto        : live per category when credentials resolve, else simulation (default)
#   live        : hard-fail at boot unless BOTH GitHub and Slack resolve
#   simulation  : in-memory simulated connectors only (never hits the network)
# HIVE_EFFECT_LEDGER                 — ledger path (default .hive/live-ledger.jsonl)

# GitHub (outbox effects open-pr / merge / post-github / open-branch)
# HIVE_GITHUB_REPO=owner/name        — target repository, REQUIRED for live GitHub
# HIVE_GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_...          — PAT or fine-grained token
# HIVE_GITHUB_USE_GH_CLI=1           — opt in to the `gh auth token` fallback (default: OFF)
# HIVE_GITHUB_API_URL=https://api.github.com          — override for GitHub Enterprise / tests
# HIVE_GITHUB_REPO=acme/www
# HIVE_GITHUB_TOKEN=

# Slack (outbox effect post-slack)
# HIVE_SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL=https://hooks.slack.com/services/T.../B.../xxx   — incoming webhook (simplest)
# HIVE_SLACK_BOT_TOKEN=xoxb-...      — alternative: Web API chat.postMessage
# HIVE_SLACK_CHANNEL=#bugs           — channel for Web API mode (and label in webhook mode)
# HIVE_SLACK_API_URL=https://slack.com/api          — override for tests
# HIVE_SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL=

# ── Postgres 16 (cloud parity with db/migrations/001_postgres_rls.sql) ────────
# Local: docker compose up -d postgres
# Verify (throwaway db `hive_rls_verify`, drops itself afterwards):
#   HIVE_PG_ADMIN_URL=postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/postgres \
#     npm run verify:postgres
# HIVE_PG_ADMIN_URL=postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/postgres

# ── Frontend (static hosting, e.g. Vercel) ────────────────────────────────────
# When the React build is hosted without the Node gateway (Vercel), point the UI
# at a reachable gateway and (optionally) send the bearer token:
# VITE_HIVE_API_BASE=https://hive-gateway.example.com
# VITE_HIVE_API_TOKEN=<same value as HIVE_GATEWAY_TOKEN>
